### Page 1 of 6

```text
MEMORANDUM
TO:

Mayor Patrick Collins, and City Council
FROM:

TJ Barttelbort, Purchasing Manager
DATE:

September 4, 2024
SUBJECT:
Consideration of Bid #S-1-25 for an Agreement between the City of Cheyenne and
Orion Environmental Inc, for the Cheyenne Railcar Project, Bid Package No. 1 ,
Asbestos and Lead Paint Abatement Project.
______________________________________________
Bid #S-1-25 was solicited for the Cheyenne Railcar Project, Bid Package No. 1 , Asbestos and Lead
Paint Abatement Project. (Vicinity Map Included).

Three (3) bidders responded to this bid, and the bid tabulation is attached.  The Bids were received
from:
1. Orion Environmental Inc
2. Rockies Environmental and Demolition Services
3. Eagle Environmental Inc.

The bids were reviewed by Paul Belotti (Mayor’s Office), Erin Gates (Engineering), and their
recommendation is to accept the lowest responsive bid from Orion Environmental Inc.

The total Bid Award is $473,028.00.

Project Completion is scheduled for December 6, 2024.

Funding:
Economic Development Administration Grant
025-21-2111-42-46541 Project #43104, $219,626.00

General Fund Reserves
$253,402.00
```

